If there is a patient-education and there is an opioid-initiation then the patient-education is critical before the opioid-initiation for a patient-preference-and-value-understanding-and-use.
If there is a patient-discussion and there is an opioid-initiation then the patient-discussion is critical before the opioid-initiation for a patient-preference-and-value-understanding-and-use.
If a patient has a patient-preference then the patient-preference can inform a clinical-decision for the patient.
If a patient has a patient-value then the patient-value can inform a clinical-decision for the patient.
If a patient has a patient-preference then it is possible that a clinician understands the patient-preference.
If a patient has a patient-value then it is possible that a clinician understands the patient-value.
